{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Judah, you — your brothers shall praise you.</b> יודוך — for your being king over them, as we find in David. And likewise יהודה has a gematria of thirty, corresponding to the number of degrees in kingship, as we say in Masechet Avot: 'And kingship in thirty degrees,' and in Sanhedrin, chapter כהן גדול, they are enumerated. Another interpretation: יודוך אחיך — because all Israel are called Jews (יהודים) after your name, and furthermore, from you will come King Mashiach, who will redeem Israel swiftly in our days."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:07:21.948467007Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}